<title>BRAZIL: TENNIS-BRAZIL AND AUSTRIA EVEN IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BRAZIL AND AUSTRIA EVEN IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil and Austria were tied</p>
<p>1-1 after the opening singles matches of their Davis Cup World</p>
<p>group qualifying tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Markus Hipfl (Austria) 4-6 3-6</p>
<p>7-6 7-6 6-1</p>
</text>
